an8.30:9.2 starts: and they will serve for your delight,
an8.30:13.3 starts: and addressed the bhikkhus:
an3.50:3.5 starts: If anyone accuses him of anything, those
an3.50:7.5 starts: If anyone accuses him of anything, those
an5.9:1.3 starts: (1) An irreverent and undeferential bhikkhu devoid
an5.9:1.4 starts: (2) An irreverent and undeferential morally shameless
